Donnie is Donovan Hale, the leader of the first [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Ghosts]], and an old companion of [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] from [[Geography/Raelion/index|Raelion]]. He moves semi-translucent, mixing with the shadows around him.

He visits Johnny at night at the [[Sin and Tonic]]. The Ghosts have a mole among them, and Donnie has split the survivors apart until he can name the traitor. [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Red]] could not be reassigned and now works with him. He knows that the new firearms out of [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]] are the work of a consultant brought in from further down the horizon, and he is asking after a way into the Teller's Run party for Johnny, who now runs with [[Org/Iconoclasm/index|Iconoclasm]].
